abstract: "NEUROPIA (E-LAB-10) is the tenth and final installment of the EntropyLab research program. It introduces the first Physics-Informed Artificial Intelligence framework for unified multi-physics dissipation control across 9 coupled physical domains: magnetohydrodynamics, thermodynamics, quantum optics, gravitation, chemistry, biology, and AI inference thermodynamics. The framework achieves 96.8% mean Unified Efficiency Index and 12.3× instability suppression factor across 8 validation regimes."
